      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It's a perfectly understandable feeling, this sudden obsolescence, but don't mistake the shift in technology for the worthlessness of your life's work. You've spent forty years building a foundation of knowledge, and that expertise doesn't just vanish because a new tool arrived. Instead of letting this feeling of being a ghost consume you, consider how you can use that deep, nuanced understanding to critique or guide these new models. Your perspective is valuable, even if the landscape has changed.",
